b: start it again to call WaitSignal once: 0x00000000
b: its WaitSignal in the new run: 0x80028005
c: start it to end at once: 0x00000000
c: a signal sent to the dormant thread: 0x00000000
c: start it again to call WaitSignal twice: 0x00000000
c: its first WaitSignal: 0x80028005
c: its second WaitSignal: 0x80028005
